# Build output and the generated mobile projects' throwaway parts.
/target/

# Written by the Tauri CLI on every build: about 1.3MB of JSON describing what each plugin's
# permissions allow. `capabilities/default.json` points its `$schema` at one of these, so an editor
# in a fresh clone will not resolve it until the first `npm run desktop` or `desktop:build` puts it
# back. The build never reads them - it writes them - so nothing else is affected.
/gen/schemas/

# Signing material must never be committed. See the release notes in CLAUDE.md.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
